ASSISTANT 2. **Define `llm-lite/config.nix`**
ASSISTANT    - Add options for OpenRouter integration (API key, endpoint, etc.):
ASSISTANT      ```nix
ASSISTANT      { lib, ... }:
ASSISTANT      let
ASSISTANT        inherit (lib) types mkOption;
ASSISTANT      in
ASSISTANT      {
ASSISTANT        options = {
ASSISTANT          development-tools.llm-lite = {
ASSISTANT            enable = mkOption {
ASSISTANT              type = types.bool;
ASSISTANT              default = false;
